    'ecosystem' => 'Patterns owns the picture in the Patterns ecosystem (what is on air, the outputs, the playout and the show graphics), and on its own it runs the speaker\'s countdown and messages to the stage too. Linked with StageWatch, its stage pages, a caller\'s station and a stage timer machine follow StageWatch\'s clock while StageWatch counts down the clip Patterns is playing, so one room has one timer. With or without StageWatch, PlayMap and AGMessage appear on Patterns\' Nodes page and in the Eye, a PlayMap added as a device takes commands from Patterns\' cues, Companion keys and OSC, and a PlayMap linked to Patterns follows its blackout and the clip it is playing.',

    'architecture' => [
        ['title' => 'One engine for every screen', 'text' => 'Every display, NDI feed and stream is drawn by the same GPU-accelerated engine, so what the wall shows, what the stream sends and what the multiview monitors always agree.'],
        ['title' => 'The audience\'s picture is kept apart', 'text' => 'The programme the audience sees is held separately from the preview you are editing, so a half-built change never leaks to air, even after a restart.'],
        ['title' => 'Supervised from the start', 'text' => 'A watchdog looks after the desk and brings it back with the same outputs and audio, and a problem drawing one picture stays in that picture while the rest of the show runs on.'],
        ['title' => 'Portable and self-contained', 'text' => 'Patterns carries its own runtime, so there is nothing to install and it starts quickly. Its settings and shows live beside it, and its settings can never stop it starting.'],
        ['title' => 'Adapts to the machine', 'text' => 'It picks the strongest graphics card, follows the displays\' frame rate and steps its particle and fractal detail down on smaller machines, so the same show runs on a laptop or a show PC.'],
        ['title' => 'Local first', 'text' => 'Everything runs on the venue\'s own network with no cloud and no licence server. Only the optional assistant and online content use the internet.'],
    ],
];
